ap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is BS 10012?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">BS 10012 is a British Standard specification for a personal information management system (PIMS). It provides a framework for governing personal information and managing data-protection responsibilities. It is not legislation and does not replace the UK GDPR, Data Protection Act 2018 or other applicable privacy laws. An audit cannot by itself establish legal compliance.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/v1791530581/7c55aab9-c489-49d8-98b1-e24e34323633_pbgz7g.webp" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="BS 10012 Data Protection"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">BS 10012 <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">BS 10012 Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Assessment against applicable personal-information management requirements within a defined scope and scheme.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Comprehensive Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Thorough on-site and documentation audits to evaluate your personal information management system effectiveness.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Public &amp; In-House Training</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Awareness and internal auditor training aligned with the requirements of the standard.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Compliance Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ongoing monitoring and corrective action support conformity under the applicable scheme.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Audit Reporting</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Clear audit findings, non-conformity reports, and certification decision records.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="lg:col-span-3"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Key Advantages</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-8">Independent assessment: focus areas</h3><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Regulatory Compliance</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">A management-system audit does not replace legal duties or other applicable requirements.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-globe-europe text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Market Access</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Some customers may request conformity evidence; requirements depend on the buyer, service and scope.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Quality Assurance</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Demonstrate commitment to protecting personal data and privacy.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-trophy text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Competitive Advantage</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">A defined scope makes processes and assessment criteria clearer to interested parties.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Risk Management</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Controls can support systematic management but cannot guarantee the absence of risk or errors.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 flex flex-col justify-center"><h3 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Choosing an assessment route</h3><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Our experienced auditors understand data protection requirements and can guide you through the certification process.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Certification availability and accreditation status depend on the selected scheme and scope. Verify current credentials before relying on a certification claim.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-9001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_webp,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367536/eurocert/m2.png.webp&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 9001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Quality Management</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-14001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_webp,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367542/eurocert/m3.png.webp&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 14001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Environmental Management</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-45001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_webp,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367547/eurocert/m4.png.webp&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 45001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">OH&amp;S Management</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Get Certified</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Quick Inquiry</h2><p class="text-white/45 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Our data protection experts are ready to guide your organisation through BS 10012 certification.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get Started <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a href="tel:+919316012883" onclick="return gtag_report_conversion('tel:+919316012883');" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-phone text-[9px]"></i> Call Us Now</a></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white" aria-labelledby="standard-details"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-5xl space-y-8"><h2 id="standard-details" class="heading-font text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Applying BS 10012 personal information management in practice</h2><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Who should consider it?</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Organisations handling personal information, including employers, service providers, retailers, health and education organisations, public bodies and businesses processing data for clients may use BS 10012. Scope should reflect real data flows: people, systems, purposes, locations, processors and international transfers. Processors still need clear responsibilities, contract controls and cooperation with controllers; a PIMS cannot transfer statutory accountability.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Key requirements</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><li>Set privacy governance, accountability, responsibilities and objectives, with oversight from relevant data-protection, security, HR, procurement and operational teams.</li><li>Identify processing activities, purposes, data categories, data subjects, recipients, retention rules, processors and transfers; keep processing records current.</li><li>Assess privacy risks and impacts and apply proportionate controls in service design, procurement, access management and change processes.</li><li>Manage data-subject requests, complaints and personal-data incidents through defined procedures, escalation paths and applicable notification decisions.</li><li>Control suppliers, train personnel, monitor system performance, audit the PIMS, review it with management and correct weaknesses; certification cannot guarantee legal compliance.</li></ul></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Certification and audit lifecycle</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">First confirm the agreed assessment criteria and whether a formal independent certification scheme is available for this standard and scope; publication of a standard does not establish that a provider or certificate is accredited. If a PIMS certification route applies, stage 1 reviews scope, context, documented system and readiness. Stage 2 samples operational processing, governance, records and controls to assess implementation and effectiveness. Findings follow the scheme's corrective-action process before an impartial decision. Certified systems are subject to planned surveillance and recertification before expiry where the scheme provides a cycle. For other assurance work, the assessor reports against agreed criteria without implying certification. Timing depends on data complexity, sites, workforce, systems, suppliers and audit rules.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Documents to prepare</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Prepare the PIMS scope; data-flow maps and processing records; privacy policies and notices; governance responsibilities and minutes; lawful-basis assessments where relevant; retention schedules; impact assessments where required; request and incident logs; processor contracts; transfer assessments; access controls; training; internal audits; management reviews; and corrective actions. Redact or securely restrict personal information supplied for sampling.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Frequently asked questions</h3><div class="space-y-4"><article><h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Is BS 10012 a privacy law?</h4><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">No. It is a British Standard. Applicable laws such as the UK GDPR and Data Protection Act 2018 remain controlling, alongside other jurisdictional rules.</p></article><article><h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Does certification guarantee legal compliance?</h4><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">No. An audit concerns a defined management system and scope at a point in time; it cannot guarantee compliance with every legal requirement or processing decision.</p></article><article><h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Who can use the standard?</h4><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Organisations that handle personal information, including controllers and processors, can consider it. Scope should reflect their actual roles and data flows.</p></article><article><h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Is accredited certification available for every scope?</h4><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Do not assume so. Verify the current scheme, the provider's competence and any accreditation scope before relying on a certificate.</p></article><article><h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">What records are useful audit evidence?</h4><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Current processing records, privacy risk assessments, supplier controls, request and incident handling, training, internal audits and management review help show operation.</p></article></div></div></div></section>
